parts.append('</table><p><strong>Common fields implicated:</strong> source_caveats (15/24), regulatory_restrictions (12), is_deidentified (10), and funders (9). <code>source_caveats</code> often documents uncertainty or correct handling of a source conflict, so its frequent appearance is not evidence that caveats themselves are wrong.</p>')
